    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T21:23:40Z",
    "body": "STOPPED: the reported refusal does not reproduce on upstream/main 6ffa808ae.\nThe pin arc_entry_without_leads_refuses_with_actionable_lead_in_hint uses Arc entry, both leads None, and a non-centre-cutting tool on an outside contour.\nThe unchanged generator returns a toolpath instead of the refusal. contour::emit_band still enables wall_arc_on with no lead-in.\nPR #3140 is still open. Its contour::emit_band change introduces the stand-down and the refusal described here.\nThe test failed at expect_err, before reaching the wording assertions. This does not show that the wording is already fixed.\nClaim released. No production code changed and no PR was opened. Failure output is saved locally in /tmp/3247-pin-before.log.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
